(label "SCL" (at 132.08 50.80 270) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "195aefe8-8169-4820-bed3-cd1e909792c6"))
(text "2Kb I2C EEPROM with pre-programmed EUI-48 MAC, SOT-23-5 - 24AA02E48T-I/OT (alt 24AA02E64T-I/OT)\nLAYOUT: 100 nF at VCC pin (<=2 mm), via straight to GND plane. Route SDA/SCL together, away from SW nodes / clocks.\nI2C needs no series termination; ONE set of 4.7k pull-ups per bus (fit here only if bus has none). Rp_max = tr / (0.847 x Cbus): 400 kHz tr=300 ns, 1 MHz tr=120 ns.\nFixed I2C address 0x50 (EEPROM) / EUI-48 at 0xFA-0xFF. \nTypical use: Ethernet MAC address (EUI-48) source for PHY/MAC. Rename SDA / SCL / WP / VDD labels to your nets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0e1b47e3-3b0b-4458-be16-e92902ba3023"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
